{"schema":"mao-cross-channel-public-site-data/1","script":"0185","rows":[{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:00000031:text","row":28726,"ordinal":1,"kind":"text","jp":"よし、原作に忠実に。","en":"All right. Stick to the script.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012036","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00001","en":"Good, let's stay loyal to the source material.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:0000005d:text","row":28727,"ordinal":2,"kind":"text","jp":"確か……。","en":"Let's see...","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012037","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00002","en":"It went...","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:000000cd:text","row":28728,"ordinal":3,"kind":"text","jp":"廊下を歩いていると、美希が掃除をしていた。","en":"While walking down the hall, I saw Miki cleaning.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012038","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00003","en":"I was walking down the corridor to find Miki cleaning.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:0000010f:text","row":28729,"ordinal":4,"kind":"text","jp":"俺の指先は電光石火で美希の尻を狙ったが、かすめただけで実体をとらえることはできなかった。","en":"My fingertips struck for her ass like lightning, but only grazed it. I failed to secure a proper handful.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-prefix-composite:ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00004","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00004","unitIds":["ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00004"],"en":"The tips of my fingers fired towards Miki's ass with the speed of lightning, but merely grazed and couldn't seize the substance.\nBut Miki had been slow up until now, enough that I could touch her as much I liked.\nThis is a most alarming problem, Headmaster!","verdict":"withheld","categories":[],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-prefix-composite:ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00004","shape":"1:2","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0185:0000010f:text","ccfc:sn:0185:0000017f:text"],"continuationRefs":["ccfc:sn:0185:0000017f:text"]}}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:0000017f:text","row":28730,"ordinal":5,"kind":"text","jp":"美希はとろくて今まで触り放題だったのに。%Nこれはゆゆしき問題ですぞ、校長！","en":"Miki used to be so slow I could touch her whenever I pleased.%NThis is a grave matter, Principal!","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[],"ghsContinuation":{"groupId":"ghs-prefix-composite:ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00004","anchorRef":"ccfc:sn:0185:0000010f:text"}},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:000001e1:text","row":28731,"ordinal":6,"kind":"text","jp":"だが弟子が腕をあげたことは、素直に嬉しい。%N師である俺が抜かれる日は近い。","en":"Still, I was honestly proud to see my disciple improve.%NThe day she surpassed her master could not be far off.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-prefix-composite:ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00005","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00005","unitIds":["ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00005"],"en":"However, a pupil growing in skill is something to be honestly happy about.\nThe day when she surpasses I, her mentor, grows near.","verdict":"withheld","categories":[],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-prefix-composite:ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00005","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0185:000001e1:text"],"continuationRefs":[]}}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:00000295:text","row":28732,"ordinal":7,"kind":"text","jp":"ふむ、電光石火で尻か。","en":"Hmm. Ass at lightning speed, huh.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012039","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00006","en":"I see, speed of lightning to the ass then.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:000002c3:text","row":28733,"ordinal":8,"kind":"text","jp":"といっても日記ゆえ細部はわからないのだが。","en":"A diary never gives you the blocking, though.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012040","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00007","en":"Though I have to say that the details of the circumstances in the diary aren't clear to me.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:0000030d:text","row":28734,"ordinal":9,"kind":"text","jp":"「てりゃー」","en":"“Hyaa.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012041","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00009","en":"Taichi: \"Teh'ryaaa.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:00000331:text","row":28735,"ordinal":10,"kind":"text","jp":"気の抜けた気合い。","en":"A battle cry with no battle in it.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012042","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00010","en":"An dispirited fighting scream,","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:0000035b:text","row":28736,"ordinal":11,"kind":"text","jp":"とともに手をのばす。","en":"I reached for her.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012043","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00011","en":"together with hands reaching out.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:0000041f:text","row":28737,"ordinal":12,"kind":"text","jp":"「っ！？」","en":"“!?”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012044","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00012","en":"Miki: \"!?!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:00000441:text","row":28738,"ordinal":13,"kind":"text","jp":"美希の目がキラリと光る。","en":"Miki's eyes flashed.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012045","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00013","en":"Miki's eyes gleam with a flash of light.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:00000518:text","row":28739,"ordinal":14,"kind":"text","jp":"がっし！","en":"Snap!","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012046","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00014","en":"Jumble!","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:00000538:text","row":28740,"ordinal":15,"kind":"text","jp":"四つ手を組んでしまった。","en":"We ended up locked in a mutual grip.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012047","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00015","en":"Four hands ended up in entangle.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:0000058d:text","row":28741,"ordinal":16,"kind":"text","jp":"「殿、殿中でござる、殿中でござるぞ……」","en":"“My lord, not within the castle! My lord!”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012048","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00016","en":"Miki: \"He-, he is inside the castle, he is inside the castle...!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:000005cd:text","row":28742,"ordinal":17,"kind":"text","jp":"キリギリギリと力が拮抗する。","en":"We strained against each other, neither giving an inch.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012049","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00017","en":"Grindy, scrapey, grindy is our close struggle for supremacy.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:00000609:text","row":28743,"ordinal":18,"kind":"text","jp":"「そちの尻をこの指先がかすめねばならんのだ、わかってくだされいっ」","en":"“These fingertips must needs brush thy buttocks. I beg thee, understand!”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012050","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00018","en":"Taichi: \"Thine ass our fingertips just have to brush, doth give me thine understanding on this!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:00000688:text","row":28744,"ordinal":19,"kind":"text","jp":"「わかりませぬ、そのような世迷い言、この美希にはとんとわかりませぬ～！」","en":"“I understand it not! Such lunacy is wholly beyond this Miki, my lord!”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012051","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00019","en":"Miki: \"I understand not nonsensical words of that sort, Miki here can understand them nooo～t!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:000006f0:text","row":28745,"ordinal":20,"kind":"text","jp":"「安心めされい。かすめるだけで、実体はとらえぬのじゃ」","en":"“Fear not. They shall but graze thee; they shall seize no substance.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012052","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00020","en":"Taichi: \"At peace be ye. 'Tis is but a brushing graze, the substance itself I shan't grasp!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:00000763:text","row":28746,"ordinal":21,"kind":"text","jp":"「わけのわからぬことを……」","en":"“Thy words are gibberish...”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012053","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00021","en":"Miki: \"That is the most ununderstandable...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:00000797:text","row":28747,"ordinal":22,"kind":"text","jp":"ギリギリギリ","en":"Nnnggggh.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012054","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00022","en":"Grind, struggle, grind, c'mon already...","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:000007c3:text","row":28748,"ordinal":23,"kind":"text","jp":"「これはゆゆしき問題ですぞ、校長！」","en":"“This is a grave matter, Principal!”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012055","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00023","en":"Taichi: \"This is a most alarming problem, Headmaster!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:000007ff:text","row":28749,"ordinal":24,"kind":"text","jp":"埒があかないので予定をはやめた。","en":"This was going nowhere, so I skipped ahead in the script.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012056","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00024","en":"Things remain progressless, so I abandon the arrangement.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:000008bd:text","row":28750,"ordinal":25,"kind":"text","jp":"「……校長？？？」","en":"“...Principal???”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012057","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00025","en":"Miki: \"...headmaster???\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:000008ef:text","row":28751,"ordinal":26,"kind":"text","jp":"「ＯＫわかった。やめよう」","en":"“Okay, okay. Forget it.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012058","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00026","en":"Taichi: \"OK got it. I'm stopping.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:00000926:text","row":28752,"ordinal":27,"kind":"text","jp":"手をほどく。","en":"I let go.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012059","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00027","en":"I unfasten my hands.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:000009e2:text","row":28753,"ordinal":28,"kind":"text","jp":"「相変わらずのご乱心ぶりで」","en":"“Your madness remains undiminished, I see.”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012060","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00028","en":"Miki: \"As ever, the manners of someone deranged.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:00000a16:text","row":28754,"ordinal":29,"kind":"text","jp":"微妙に警戒している。","en":"She was still watching me warily.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012061","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00029","en":"She's on a very subtle guard.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:00000a42:text","row":28755,"ordinal":30,"kind":"text","jp":"隙のない娘に育ったものだ。","en":"She had grown up without a single opening left to exploit.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012062","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00030","en":"She has grown to be a girl without vulnerabilities.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:00000a7c:text","row":28756,"ordinal":31,"kind":"text","jp":"「腕をあげたな」","en":"“You've gotten good.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012063","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00031","en":"Taichi: \"Your skill's improved din'nit.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:00000b2a:text","row":28757,"ordinal":32,"kind":"text","jp":"「いえいえ」","en":"“Oh, hardly.”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012064","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00032","en":"Miki: \"Well now, well now.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:00000b56:text","row":28758,"ordinal":33,"kind":"text","jp":"「昔は、ただ揉まれるばかりだったその尻、もはや容易く触れることのできないものになりつつあるようだ」","en":"“Once, that ass of yours could do nothing but submit to a kneading. Now it seems to be slipping beyond easy reach.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012065","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00033","en":"Taichi: \"Once upon a time that arse had only ever received massages, but it seems to be already in the process of becoming something that cannot be touched so easily.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:00000c56:text","row":28759,"ordinal":34,"kind":"text","jp":"「いえいえいえ」","en":"“Oh, no, no.”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012066","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00034","en":"Miki: \"Well now, well now, well now.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:00000c86:text","row":28760,"ordinal":35,"kind":"text","jp":"「だが弟子が腕をあげたことは、素直に嬉しい。師である俺が抜かれる日は近い」","en":"“Still, I was honestly proud to see my disciple improve. The day she surpassed her master could not be far off.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012067","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00035","en":"Taichi: \"However, a pupil growing in skill is something to be honestly happy about. The day when she surpasses I, her mentor, grows near.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:00000ce8:text","row":28761,"ordinal":36,"kind":"text","jp":"棒読み。","en":"Delivered in a perfect monotone.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012068","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00036","en":"Merely reading in monotone without interpreting its meaning.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:00000d8e:text","row":28762,"ordinal":37,"kind":"text","jp":"「さっきからどうも妙なことを口走っておられますな」","en":"“You have been saying some very strange things for a while now, sir.”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012069","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00037","en":"Miki: \"You've been blurting out odd things for a while now.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:00000de0:text","row":28763,"ordinal":38,"kind":"text","jp":"「気にしないで。予定調和大好きっ子なんで」","en":"“Never mind. I'm a sucker for a scripted outcome.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012070","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00038","en":"Taichi: \"Don't mind it. I'm just someone who loves harmonie preetablie from the roots.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:00000ea8:text","row":28764,"ordinal":39,"kind":"text","jp":"「……はー」","en":"“...Huh.”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012071","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00039","en":"Miki: \"...sigh.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:00000ecc:text","row":28765,"ordinal":40,"kind":"text","jp":"呆れていた。","en":"She looked exasperated.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012072","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00040","en":"Appalled,","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:00000f51:text","row":28766,"ordinal":41,"kind":"text","jp":"すぐにくすりと笑う。","en":"Then she gave a little laugh.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012073","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00041","en":"but soon a laugh slips out.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:00000fa2:text","row":28767,"ordinal":42,"kind":"text","jp":"「ほんと、相変わらずで」","en":"“You really haven't changed.”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012074","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00042","en":"Miki: \"Seriously, like always.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:00001058:text","row":28768,"ordinal":43,"kind":"text","jp":"「こぉんなことになってるのに」","en":"“Even with all this going on.”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012075","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00043","en":"Miki: \"Even when it turned out juuust like this.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:00001096:text","row":28769,"ordinal":44,"kind":"text","jp":"「つうてもねぇ」","en":"“Well...”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012076","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00044","en":"Taichi: \"So it seems, yeah.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:000010c6:text","row":28770,"ordinal":45,"kind":"text","jp":"「死体とかないし、文字通り消失してるわけで」","en":"“No bodies or anything. Everyone's literally just gone.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012077","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00045","en":"Taichi: \"No bodies, nothing, a very literal disappearance act.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:00001112:text","row":28771,"ordinal":46,"kind":"text","jp":"「どうも実感がない」","en":"“It just doesn’t feel real.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012078","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00046","en":"Taichi: \"It just doesn't feel real.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:00001163:text","row":28772,"ordinal":47,"kind":"text","jp":"「ですね」","en":"“No, it doesn’t.”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012079","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00047","en":"Miki: \"So true.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:0000118d:text","row":28773,"ordinal":48,"kind":"text","jp":"「犬とか猫とかも見ないし、蝉だって鳴いてない」","en":"“No dogs, no cats. Even the cicadas have gone quiet.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012080","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00048","en":"Taichi: \"Haven't seen dogs or cats, haven't heard the cries of the cicadas either.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:000011db:text","row":28774,"ordinal":49,"kind":"text","jp":"「人間って体内の微生物がいなくなったら、マズイんじゃなかった？」","en":"“Wouldn't humans be in trouble if all the microorganisms inside us disappeared too?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012081","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00049","en":"Taichi: \"If the microorganisms inside the human bodies were gone, wouldn't it be really bad?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:000012b9:text","row":28775,"ordinal":50,"kind":"text","jp":"「体内のは無事なんじゃないですか？」","en":"“Maybe the ones inside us are fine?”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012082","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00050","en":"Miki: \"But shouldn't they be safe inside the body?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:000012fd:text","row":28776,"ordinal":51,"kind":"text","jp":"「だよねぇ」","en":"“Must be.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012083","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00051","en":"Taichi: \"Right you are.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:000013a7:text","row":28777,"ordinal":52,"kind":"text","jp":"「すっごくいい加減な事態であるとか」","en":"“Maybe the whole phenomenon is just wildly half-assed.”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012084","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00052","en":"Miki: \"But maybe there's something just reallly off in this situation.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:000013eb:text","row":28778,"ordinal":53,"kind":"text","jp":"「たとえば？」","en":"“For example?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012085","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00053","en":"Taichi: \"For example?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:00001497:text","row":28779,"ordinal":54,"kind":"text","jp":"「んー」","en":"“Hmm.”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012086","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00054","en":"Miki: \"Hmmm.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:000014b7:text","row":28780,"ordinal":55,"kind":"text","jp":"祈るように合わせた手を顎に添えて、美希は考えている。","en":"Miki clasped her hands beneath her chin as though in prayer, thinking.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012087","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00055","en":"Miki meets her hands at her chin as if praying, and thinks.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:00001503:text","row":28781,"ordinal":56,"kind":"text","jp":"キュートだった。","en":"Adorable.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012088","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00056","en":"That was kyuuute.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:00001533:text","row":28782,"ordinal":57,"kind":"text","jp":"「その仕草いいね」","en":"“I like that pose.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012089","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00057","en":"Taichi: \"Nice gesture that.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:000015e3:text","row":28783,"ordinal":58,"kind":"text","jp":"「どうも。たとえば……夢を見ているとか」","en":"“Thanks. Maybe... we're dreaming?”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012090","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00058","en":"Miki: \"Thanks. For example... we could be dreaming.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:0000162b:text","row":28784,"ordinal":59,"kind":"text","jp":"「夢オチかぁ」","en":"“The it-was-all-a-dream ending, huh.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012091","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00059","en":"Taichi: \"The 'it was all a dream' ending, yes.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:00001651:text","row":28785,"ordinal":60,"kind":"text","jp":"憂鬱になるな。","en":"How depressing.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012092","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00060","en":"That'd be depressing.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:000016fd:text","row":28786,"ordinal":61,"kind":"text","jp":"「憂鬱になりますね」","en":"“That would be depressing.”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012093","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00061","en":"Miki: \"That would be depressing.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:00001729:text","row":28787,"ordinal":62,"kind":"text","jp":"おお、同志。","en":"Ah, a kindred spirit.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012094","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00062","en":"Oooh, a kindred soul!","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:00001755:text","row":28788,"ordinal":63,"kind":"text","jp":"「現実感のなさは確かに夢そのものなのだけど」","en":"“It certainly feels like a dream. None of this seems real.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012095","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00063","en":"Taichi: \"The lack of sense of reality is indeed indicative of a dream, however,\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:000017a1:text","row":28789,"ordinal":64,"kind":"text","jp":"「俺の予測ではこうだ」","en":"“Here's my theory.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012096","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00064","en":"Taichi: \"I predict the following:\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:000017dc:text","row":28790,"ordinal":65,"kind":"text","jp":"「ＦＳ現象！」","en":"“The FS phenomenon!”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012097","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00065","en":"Taichi: \"The FS Phenomenon!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:00001888:text","row":28791,"ordinal":66,"kind":"text","jp":"「……フライング……シ、シ……シャ……」","en":"“...Flying... s-s-sher...”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012098","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00066","en":"Miki: \"...Flying... s, sha... shi...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:00001960:text","row":28792,"ordinal":67,"kind":"text","jp":"「シャーベット、ですか？」","en":"“Sherbet?”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012099","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00067","en":"Miki: \"Sherbet, is it?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:0000199a:text","row":28793,"ordinal":68,"kind":"text","jp":"「違うな」","en":"“Nope.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012100","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00068","en":"Taichi: \"Nope.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:00001a42:text","row":28794,"ordinal":69,"kind":"text","jp":"「フライング……シャ……シャ」","en":"“Flying... sch... scha...”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012101","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00069","en":"Miki: \"Flying... shi... scha...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:00001afe:text","row":28795,"ordinal":70,"kind":"text","jp":"「シャーレ」","en":"“Schale.”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012102","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00070","en":"Miki: \"Schale!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:00001b2a:text","row":28796,"ordinal":71,"kind":"text","jp":"「空飛ぶペトリ皿。残念、ハズレ」","en":"“A flying Petri dish. Nice try, but wrong.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012103","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00071","en":"Taichi: \"A petri dish flying in the sky. Unfortunately, you fail.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:00001be8:text","row":28797,"ordinal":72,"kind":"text","jp":"「フライングぅ～……シャ……シャ……」","en":"“Flyiiing... sh... sher...”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012104","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00072","en":"Miki: \"Flyin～ng... shi... she...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:00001cac:text","row":28798,"ordinal":73,"kind":"text","jp":"「シャーロキアン」","en":"“Sherlockian.”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012105","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00073","en":"Miki: \"Sherlockian!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:00001cde:text","row":28799,"ordinal":74,"kind":"text","jp":"「ホームズか。ヤツが身につけた日本式レスリング・バリツは俺も認めるスゴイ格闘技」","en":"“Holmes, huh? His Japanese wrestling art, baritsu—now that’s one hell of a martial art. Even I have to give it credit.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012106","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00074","en":"Taichi: \"Holmes then. That guy learned the Japanese Style of Baritsu Wrestling that even I must admit to be an amazing form of unarmed combat.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:00001dcc:text","row":28800,"ordinal":75,"kind":"text","jp":"「……実在してましたか、アレ」","en":"“...Was that ever a real thing?”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012107","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00075","en":"Miki: \"...was it even real that one.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:00001e0a:text","row":28801,"ordinal":76,"kind":"text","jp":"「カラデと双璧をなす」","en":"“It stands shoulder to shoulder with karade.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012108","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00076","en":"Taichi: \"It forms a matchless pair together with Karade.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:00001e5d:text","row":28802,"ordinal":77,"kind":"text","jp":"「どちらも全然聞いたことないんですけど」","en":"“I've never heard of either one.”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012109","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00077","en":"Miki: \"But I've never ever heard of either at all.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:00001ea5:text","row":28803,"ordinal":78,"kind":"text","jp":"「メタアーツだからな」","en":"“They're meta-arts.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012110","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00078","en":"Taichi: \"Because they're meta-arts.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:00001f59:text","row":28804,"ordinal":79,"kind":"text","jp":"「？？？」","en":"“???”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012111","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00079","en":"Miki: \"???\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:00001f83:text","row":28805,"ordinal":80,"kind":"text","jp":"「特定の条件を満たした相手しか倒せない」","en":"“They can only defeat an opponent who meets certain conditions.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012112","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00080","en":"Taichi: \"They're only capable of defeating opponents that meet certain requirements.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:00002049:text","row":28806,"ordinal":81,"kind":"text","jp":"「……ゴミ武道じゃないですか」","en":"“...Those are garbage martial arts.”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012113","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00081","en":"Miki: \"...they're garbage martial arts aren't they.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:00002087:text","row":28807,"ordinal":82,"kind":"text","jp":"「ゲームってのは突き詰めるとメタに行きつくの！」","en":"“Take any game far enough and it all comes down to the metagame!”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012114","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00082","en":"Taichi: \"Take the game seriously, follow it to its logical conclusion and you will end up in the meta!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:000020cf:text","row":28808,"ordinal":83,"kind":"text","jp":"興奮した。","en":"I got worked up.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012115","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00083","en":"I started heating up.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:00002116:text","row":28809,"ordinal":84,"kind":"text","jp":"「そんなもんですか……」","en":"“If you say so...”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012116","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00084","en":"Miki: \"Is that what it is then...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:0000214e:text","row":28810,"ordinal":85,"kind":"text","jp":"「特定の相手にはメチャ強ですよ」","en":"“Against the right matchup, they're absurdly strong.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012117","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00085","en":"Taichi: \"The specific adversary is one of absurdly powerful Mecha-Strength!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:00002186:text","row":28811,"ordinal":86,"kind":"text","jp":"地球上にはいない生物像も多いが。","en":"Granted, quite a few of their target species did not exist on Earth.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012118","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00086","en":"And there have been many sightings of biological entities that do not exist on this Earth, too.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:000021c6:text","row":28812,"ordinal":87,"kind":"text","jp":"「美希のカラデもだいぶ様になってきたよ」","en":"“Your karade is starting to look pretty sharp too, Miki.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012119","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00087","en":"Taichi: \"Miki's Karade has reached grandmaster levels too!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:0000228c:text","row":28813,"ordinal":88,"kind":"text","jp":"「ずっと叩き込まれてきたコレはカラデとかいうわけのわからん格闘技だったとですか！？」","en":"“You mean this incomprehensible fighting style you've spent all this time pounding into me was karade?!”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012120","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00088","en":"Miki: \"You mean what you've been always drilling into me is that martial art of meaning incomprehensible you call Karade?!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:00002300:text","row":28814,"ordinal":89,"kind":"text","jp":"「わけのわからんは余計です！」","en":"“You didn't have to call it incomprehensible!”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012121","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00089","en":"Taichi: \"That 'meaning incomprehensible' was most uncalled for!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:000023bc:text","row":28815,"ordinal":90,"kind":"text","jp":"「……ショックを受けました」","en":"“...I'm shocked.”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012122","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00090","en":"Miki: \"...I have received a shock.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:000023f8:text","row":28816,"ordinal":91,"kind":"text","jp":"「うむ」","en":"“Mm-hm.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012123","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00091","en":"Taichi: \"Uh-huh.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:0000249e:text","row":28817,"ordinal":92,"kind":"text","jp":"「フライング　シャイ」","en":"“Flying shy.”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012124","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00092","en":"Miki: \"Flying Shy!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:000024cc:text","row":28818,"ordinal":93,"kind":"text","jp":"急に戻る会話。","en":"And just like that, the conversation snapped back.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012125","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00093","en":"Sudden return to previous conversation.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:000024fa:text","row":28819,"ordinal":94,"kind":"text","jp":"「空飛ぶはにかみ屋。絵にしたらすごく笑えそうだな」","en":"“A flying wallflower. Just picture it—that’d be hilarious.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012126","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00094","en":"Taichi: \"A particularly shy person flying in the sky. It'd be really ridiculous if someone were to draw that.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:000025ca:text","row":28820,"ordinal":95,"kind":"text","jp":"「で結局ＦＳ現象というのは？」","en":"“So what is the FS phenomenon, anyway?”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012127","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00095","en":"Miki: \"So, in the end, what's the FS Phenomenon?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:00002608:text","row":28821,"ordinal":96,"kind":"text","jp":"「ごめん、ＳＦ現象だった。間違い」","en":"“Sorry. I meant SF. Had it backward.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012128","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00096","en":"Taichi: \"Sorry, it was the SF Phenomenon. My mistake.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:000026b0:text","row":28822,"ordinal":97,"kind":"text","jp":"「……………………」","en":"“........................”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012129","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00097","en":"Miki: \"............\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:000026dc:text","row":28823,"ordinal":98,"kind":"text","jp":"ごっそり裏をかかれたような、形容しがたい表情をした。","en":"She made an indescribable face, as though she’d just been completely blindsided.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012130","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00098","en":"She made a facial expression as if completely and thoroughly outsmarted, that is hard to attach adjectives to.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:00002730:text","row":28824,"ordinal":99,"kind":"text","jp":"「すこしふしぎ現象といって……」","en":"“It stands for sukoshi fushigi—‘a little mysterious’...”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012131","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00099","en":"Taichi: \"It's a somewhat freaky phenomenon, so to say...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:000027ee:text","row":28825,"ordinal":100,"kind":"text","jp":"「あ、もういいです。その時点でわかりました」","en":"“Oh, that’s enough. I get it now.”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012132","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00100","en":"Miki: \"Ah, whatever then. I understood it at that moment.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:0000283a:text","row":28826,"ordinal":101,"kind":"text","jp":"「……あ、そう……？」","en":"“...Oh. You do...?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012133","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00101","en":"Taichi: \"...you, did...?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:00002900:text","row":28827,"ordinal":102,"kind":"text","jp":"「要するに、わからんなぁ、ということですよね」","en":"“So basically, it means, ‘We have no idea,’ right?”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012134","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00102","en":"Miki: \"In other words 'dunnooo', that's what it means.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:0000294e:text","row":28828,"ordinal":103,"kind":"text","jp":"「科学は無力だね」","en":"“Science is powerless.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012135","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00103","en":"Taichi: \"Science is powerless innit.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:00002980:text","row":28829,"ordinal":104,"kind":"text","jp":"「というわけでサインの時間です」","en":"“Which means it's autograph time.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012136","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00104","en":"Taichi: \"And with that said, it's signing time.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:000029c0:text","row":28830,"ordinal":105,"kind":"text","jp":"「愛王子スタンプサインラリー。ミキミキはいくつためたのかなー？」","en":"“The Prince of Love Stamp-and-Sign Rally! How many have you collected, Miki-Miki?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012137","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00105","en":"Taichi: \"Love Prince Stamp Signature Collection. How many has Miki-Miki collected I wonder?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:00002a9e:text","row":28831,"ordinal":106,"kind":"text","jp":"「はい、ミキミキです。サインをもらうのは久しぶりです」","en":"“Miki-Miki here. It’s been a while since my last autograph.”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012138","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00106","en":"Miki: \"Yes, this is Miki-Miki. It has been a while since the last reception of a signature.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:00002af4:text","row":28832,"ordinal":107,"kind":"text","jp":"「夏休みだったしね」","en":"“Summer break will do that.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012139","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00107","en":"Taichi: \"It was Summer Vacation after all.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:00002b20:text","row":28833,"ordinal":108,"kind":"text","jp":"手帳を受け取る。","en":"I took her handbook.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012140","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00108","en":"I was given a booklet.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:00002b48:text","row":28834,"ordinal":109,"kind":"text","jp":"メイトブックだ。","en":"Her Mate Book.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012141","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00109","en":"It's the Matebook.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:00002b70:text","row":28835,"ordinal":110,"kind":"text","jp":"初代校長が名店ソープ『メイトブック』であまりの快楽によって悟りを開いたことにちなんでそう呼ばれ嘘である。","en":"The name supposedly honors our first principal, who attained enlightenment through sheer ecstasy at the prestigious soapland Mate Book. This is a lie.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012142","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00110","en":"The book taking its name from the famous Soapland \"Matebook\" in which the first-generation school Headmaster achieved enlightenment via excessive pleasure is nothing but a lie.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:00002bf8:text","row":28836,"ordinal":111,"kind":"text","jp":"「……」","en":"“...”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012143","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00111","en":"Taichi: \"...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:00002c18:text","row":28837,"ordinal":112,"kind":"text","jp":"手帳は俺の落書きで埋まっている。","en":"My scribbles filled the handbook.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012144","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00112","en":"The booklet is buried in my scribbles.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:00002c50:text","row":28838,"ordinal":113,"kind":"text","jp":"白紙のページに、新たなサインを記す。","en":"I added a fresh autograph to a blank page.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012145","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00113","en":"I jot down a new signature in a fresh blank page.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:00002c94:text","row":28839,"ordinal":114,"kind":"text","jp":"「２０コためるとすごいサービスが」","en":"“Collect twenty and you get an amazing bonus service.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012146","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00114","en":"Taichi: \"Collect 20 of them and you'll have an amazing service!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:00002d54:text","row":28840,"ordinal":115,"kind":"text","jp":"「……Ｈな悪戯なんだろうなぁ」","en":"“...Bet it's some dirty prank.”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012147","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00115","en":"Miki: \"...it's totally a sexual prank!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:00002d92:text","row":28841,"ordinal":116,"kind":"text","jp":"「ん、なんか言った？」","en":"“Hm? Did you say something?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012148","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00116","en":"Taichi: \"Hm, did you say something?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:00002e46:text","row":28842,"ordinal":117,"kind":"text","jp":"「いいえ」","en":"“No.”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012149","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00117","en":"Miki: \"I did not.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0185:00002e70:text","row":28843,"ordinal":118,"kind":"text","jp":"「さて、こんなとこかな、ノルマは」","en":"“Well, that should do it for my quota.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012150","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0016a:00118","en":"Taichi: \"Well then, with this one I met my quota.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]}]}
